ngine/godot/issues/comments/6072912633","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124276#issuecomment-6072912633","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124276","id":6072912633,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaflK-Q","user":{"login":"vino3dx","id":63284484,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjg0NDg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63284484?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vino3dx","html_url":"https://github.com/vino3dx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vino3dx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vino3dx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vino3dx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vino3dx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vino3dx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vino3dx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vino3dx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vino3dx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vino3dx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-09T02:19:12Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T02:19:12Z","body":"hi bro. I’ve run into this issue as well. How can I quickly resolve it? Or should I revert to the previous version, v4.6?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6072912633/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6076054365","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124276#issuecomment-6076054365","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124276","id":6076054365,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaik7XQ","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-09T06:57:42Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T06:57:42Z","body":"I can't reproduce it, but it should be fine to not filter messages when app is not focused. Is it causing any real issue or just showing state in the task manager.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6076054365/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6092753582","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124276#issuecomment-6092753582","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124276","id":6092753582,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaygKrg","user":{"login":"vino3dx","id":63284484,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjg0NDg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63284484?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vino3dx","html_url":"https://github.com/vino3dx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vino3dx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vino3dx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vino3dx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vino3dx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vino3dx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vino3dx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vino3dx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vino3dx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vino3dx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-10T02:29:43Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T02:29:43Z","body":"as far as I know, the program briefly returns to normal when you focus on it, but a few seconds later it shows as \"Not Responding\" again and experiences stuttering.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6092753582/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6104096484","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124276#issuecomment-6104096484","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124276","id":6104096484,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABa9Ue5A","user":{"login":"Unorlex","id":330947608,"node_id":"U_kgDOE7ncGA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/330947608?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unorlex","html_url":"https://github.com/Unorlex","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unorlex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unorlex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unorlex/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unorlex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unorlex/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unorlex/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unorlex/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unorlex/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Unorlex/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-11T01:14:29Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T01:14:29Z","body":"Thank you for looking into this and for suggesting a fix.\n\nRegarding the actual impact: in my own game (approximately 60 FPS, VSync ON), no FPS drops or stuttering have occurred so far, even while Task Manager shows \"Not Responding\".\nIn addition, in separate tests using an empty project, Godot's internal process, physics, and render counters kept increasing while the window was in the \"Not Responding\" state.\n\nRegarding the fix: \"Not Responding\" occurs even when the window is in the foreground, if it is left idle without any interaction. Because of this, I think a change that applies only when the window is not focused may not resolve the issue in some cases.\n\nAs additional information, in Godot 4.7.2, I made a two-line change in `DisplayServerWindows::process_events()`: immediately before `process_raw_input()`, I added a local `MSG` variable declaration and a single unfiltered `PeekMessageW(..., PM_NOREMOVE)` call.\nWith this change applied, the \"Not Responding\" classification no longer occurred in my test environment. The issue also did not occur during 5-minute and 15-minute idle tests.\nHowever, when I applied the same two-line change to Godot 4.8-dev7, the issue still occurred.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6104096484/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6323745952","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124276#issuecomment-6323745952","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124276","id":6323745952,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABeOy0oA","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-21T18:42:02Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T18:42:02Z","body":"I can't reproduce this on 4.7.2.stable or 4.8.beta1.\n\n> Godot v4.7.2.stable - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 (NVIDIA; 32.0.16.1656) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 63.55 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6323745952/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6340555892","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124276#issuecomment-6340555892","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124276","id":6340555892,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABee00dA","user":{"login":"BaconEggsRL","id":18596035,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTk2MDM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18596035?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL","html_url":"https://github.com/BaconEggsRL","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-22T12:18:50Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T12:29:56Z","body":"Confirmed on 4.7.2.stable and 4.8.beta1.\n\nThe Windows task manager must be in the \"Details\" tab. The default \"Processes\" tab does not show the relevant status.\nIn the details tab after ~5 seconds or so, the Godot process will always change Status from Running to Not Responding.\nIf you switch back to processes tab it will briefly show Not Responding, then disappear. Switching back to Details tab will still show Not Responding.\n\nIn 4.8.beta1, this only happened in the running editor, not the project manager.\nFor 4.7.2 it happens in both.\nEdit: I was able to reproduce in the project manager on 4.8.beta1, but it will stay Running once interacted with once.\n\nIn the console executable, the console window stays Running the whole time. Only the editor/project manager is affected.\nChanging the Interface > Editor setting to Update Continuously did not fix it.\nThis occurred both when the window was focused and unfocused.\n\nAs for actual impact--I do not know of any. I was still able to interact with the editor as normal. Not sure what side effects this may have on development.\n\n> Godot v4.8.beta1 - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor (1920x1080 @ 144.00 Hz) - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6590) - AMD Ryzen 9 5900HS with Radeon Graphics (16 threads) - 15.40 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6340555892/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]